{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01251",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 4.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.46,
      "end_seconds": 10.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.94,
      "end_seconds": 14.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "It's a cut on my finger, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.17,
      "end_seconds": 20.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.05,
      "end_seconds": 25.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "It's been about three months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.43,
      "end_seconds": 30.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Okay, what do you do to make it better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.08,
      "end_seconds": 36.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "It settles a little with a plaster and pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.46,
      "end_seconds": 40.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.51,
      "end_seconds": 51.68,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "A little bleeding goes along with it, most of the time. The little bleeding? That's been for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.91,
      "end_seconds": 57.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any dirty blade or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.41,
      "end_seconds": 63.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "I haven't had dirty blade or numbness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.62,
      "end_seconds": 68.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.92,
      "end_seconds": 71.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.47,
      "end_seconds": 77.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.89,
      "end_seconds": 80.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.17,
      "end_seconds": 92.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.02,
      "end_seconds": 99.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.02,
      "end_seconds": 118.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.35,
      "end_seconds": 122.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.26,
      "end_seconds": 126.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.8,
      "end_seconds": 131.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.59,
      "end_seconds": 136.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.05,
      "end_seconds": 141.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.94,
      "end_seconds": 145.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.05,
      "end_seconds": 154.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.19,
      "end_seconds": 168.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.53,
      "end_seconds": 173.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "It's, It's carvedilol, twice a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.8,
      "end_seconds": 177.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.81,
      "end_seconds": 180.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "It's 6.25 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.37,
      "end_seconds": 188.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.72,
      "end_seconds": 191.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "I have heart failure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.52,
      "end_seconds": 203.08,
      "duration_seconds": 10.56,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Right, so heart failure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.42,
      "end_seconds": 218.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.23,
      "end_seconds": 251.99,
      "duration_seconds": 11.76,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 20.9, weight 64 kilos, temperature 36.7, blood pressure 117 over 80, pulse 79, height 175 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.63,
      "end_seconds": 254.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.72,
      "end_seconds": 259.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.77,
      "end_seconds": 265.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.65,
      "end_seconds": 268.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.57,
      "end_seconds": 293.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "It's a clean shallow cut, no longer bleeding, and the finger moves normally."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.73,
      "end_seconds": 296.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.72,
      "end_seconds": 303.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.53,
      "end_seconds": 318.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards a minor clean wound that needs only dressing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.43,
      "end_seconds": 322.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Is this serious, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.09,
      "end_seconds": 339.51,
      "duration_seconds": 16.42,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a minor clean wound that needs only dressing. So, to recap quickly. You've had a cut on your finger for about three months, and no dirty blade or numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.55,
      "end_seconds": 344.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Let me think, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.76,
      "end_seconds": 361.78,
      "duration_seconds": 15.02,
      "text": "I'll close it with adhesive strips and keep it dry for two days. If the finger turns red, hot or swollen, that's the point to come in urgently. See me again if it looks red or swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.46,
      "end_seconds": 364.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.25,
      "end_seconds": 370.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.49,
      "end_seconds": 375.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}